</p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>10</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>李腾飞副教授</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/R1Wicnb6bXL8SB60GmviaebPPzRpGvYtlj5lCN2W8EC5vuXiccTrFyicu102ZxuyObd7MR0rNTXB63vqU0L0diay9WA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>哲学博士、硕士生导师。培养方向：中西方哲学比较研究、宋明理学史。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>11</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>张俊杰副教授</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/9icGXCdjRxGJictQ2QJK3ZpBamJYWgtoc6hZ8swicsQmUPXpzLIk7GeXrXRhhdZxdXOrAQJ3VcQT5MciaBNonawx2fWAX77nV8OUibEvAkRbMgb0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>历史学博士、硕士生导师。培养方向：</span><span>中国古代礼乐文化史</span><span>、秦汉思想史。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>NO.5</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>推免要求</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/j-GVrPpgwZEI-2WjVyybHg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#01</a></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>基本条件</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.2027届普通全日制本科毕业生，取得本科所在学校的推免资格。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.具有高尚的爱国主义情操和集体主义精神，社会主义信念坚定，社会责任感强，遵纪守法，积极向上，身心健康。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3.勤奋学习，刻苦钻研，成绩优秀；学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4.诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>5.品行表现优良，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>6.在本科阶段公开发表过学术论文或在国内外重大竞赛中获奖者可优先考虑。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/j-GVrPpgwZEI-2WjVyybHg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#02</a></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请方式</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.预报名：</span><span>2026年</span></span><span><strong><span><span>9月1日—9月17日</span></span></strong></span><span><span>，申请人登录“西北大学推免生预报名系统”（</span></span><span><span>https://zhaosheng.eol.cn/10697/user/login/login</span></span><span>）进行报名（建议用pc端登录完成填报）。</span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>院（系、所）通知复试：</span>院（系、所）对推免生的报名信息进行初审，确定复试名单，向申请人发放复试通知。请考生关注所报学院的官网并保证电话畅通。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3.考生参加复试，思想所确定拟录取名单。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4.考生复试须携带以下证明材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）学生证、身份证原件</span></p><p><span>（2）加盖学校教务部门公章的成绩单</span></p><p><span>（3）学术科研成果（公开发表的论文、出版的专著等）和获奖证书</span></p><p><span>（4）外语水平证明（大学英语四级、六级考试、托福、雅思、PETS等成绩单）</span></p><p><span>（5）参加社会实践、公益事业等证明</span></p><p><span>（6）其他可反映自身能力和水平的相关材料</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/j-GVrPpgwZEI-2WjVyybHg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#03</a></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>接收工作</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.</span><span>待“教育部推免服务系统”开通后，考生需登录“教育部推免服务系统”进行注册，并按照拟接收的专业填报相关志愿。西北大学将在“教育部推免服务系统”中发放复试通知和拟录取通知。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>未进行预报名的同学在“教育部推免服务系统”开通后可进行报名。各院（系、所）将根据接收指标剩余情况决定是否发放复试通知和组织复试，具体安排以各院（系、所）的通知为准。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>申请直博的推免生须按上述推免生要求参加网上报名与复试，复试时向招生单位提出直博申请。经招生单位同意后，可按直博生进行复试录取。西北大学2027年招生目录将于2026年9月中下旬公布，相关专业可参考《西北大学2026年硕士研究生招生专业目录》。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>        </span><span><span>西北大学中国思想文化研究所</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026年9月1日</span></span></p></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/R1Wicnb6bXL9icViahp6HNaEFaXA8KtKKjcLPfXIfVomVlU8icruh3UyJnPMfTKqNCAn3cXcbyDu9LhdbuHqIwFb6w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><blockquote><section><section><span><span>※点击下方链接跳转至“</span></span><span><span>西北大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生预报名公告</span></span><span><span>”</span></span></section></section><section><span>西大宣传部，公众号：西北大学<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oWEI8lyQFmifzTnxxT0WGw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">西北大学2027年接收推荐免试研究生 （含直博生）预报名公告</a></span></section></blockquote><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p></p></div>","textSha256":"b086639b13a04681aa78a3612fc8013751c45de1516c48f84708c666434f3f58","textLength":3375,"sourceSha256":"64aa5fb767723a46edc60bd019c3d130ac652a2fd3788939114afdb09652969e","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-238be8f815168209133e","title":"2026年西北大学中国思想文化研究所2027年招收推荐免试硕士研究生","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:25.108972+00:00"}
